############################################################
# NOTES
############################################################

# 1. All endpoints require authentication via Bearer token
# 2. The userId in create request is optional - if not provided, it uses the authenticated user's ID
# 3. When an experience demand is approved or rejected, isUnderReview is automatically set to false
# 4. Review note is required when rejecting an experience demand
# 5. Review status can only be 'pending', 'approved', or 'rejected'
# 6. ExFile must reference a valid file in FileHub
# 7. All timestamps are in ISO 8601 format (UTC)
# 8. Pagination defaults: page=1, limit=10
# 9. Sorting defaults: sortBy='createdAt', sortOrder='DESC'
# 10. When creating a new experience demand, isUnderReview is automatically set to true and reviewStatus to 'pending'
